' 'FULL_COMMIT_SHA'\n本会话的 CLI 会将 submit、status、issue 请求写到 A2A_REQUEST_DIR 指向的本 attempt 专用 /tmp 目录；不直接连接 socket。queued=true 只表示已排队，不是门禁通过。最后结束回合，让 Stop hook 读取并转交；没有请求文件就不交付。请求文件不得进入 Git 提交。查状态用同一入口 status --task，问题上报用 issue --task --title --body。不要修改合同、验收程序或沙箱权限。"}},{"seq":27,"time":"2026-10-14T20:18:52.349Z","task":"T-081-self-report-unchanged","attempt":"6c725cc1-0808-4d3c-8066-e86ee0a0f085","type":"dispatched","details":{"attempt":{"task_id":"T-081-self-report-unchanged","attempt_id":"6c725cc1-0808-4d3c-8066-e86ee0a0f085","session_id":"ac06c05a-c046-4d28-b6dd-1d2c3c970180","fence":1,"spec_rev":1,"thread_id":"58dfed86-bd47-4481-b1f7-c69ba1e23814","runtime_mode":"workspace-write","turn_id":null,"runtime_identity":{"launch":"4907ee9a-a8cd-48b3-a9c7-d4289d3dd341","thread":"58dfed86-bd47-4481-b1f7-c69ba1e23814","shell_pid":31000,"leader_pid":31001,"native_session":"fixture-native-4907ee9a-a8cd-48b3-a9c7-d4289d3dd341"},"workspace":"/private/tmp/q76-tdoed8ue/c-dyvva2_y/state/worktrees/fixture/T-081-self-report-unchanged-a1","base_commit":"d293499ea484933b442900aab4742a2cc52f795b","card_snapshot_id":"ad91d46d-f89e-4a4b-b4c5-c21bdb98b73e","reclaimed":false,"owner":"T-081-self-report-unchanged","state":"claimed"}}},{"seq":28,"time":"2026-10-14T20:18:53.462Z","task":"T-081-self-report-unchanged","attempt":"6c725cc1-0808-4d3c-8066-e86ee0a0f085","type":"command_intent","details":{"argv":["git","-C","/private/tmp/q76-tdoed8ue/c-dyvva2_y/repo","cat-file","-t","de8cb68e698db5a8adf5a935f020c32ce29db9e7"],"cwd":"/private/tmp/q76-tdoed8ue/c-dyvva2_y/repo"}},{"seq":29,"time":"2026-10-14T20:18:53.468Z","task":"T-081-self-report-unchanged","attempt":"6c725cc1-0808-4d3c-8066-e86ee0a0f085","type":"command_result","details":{"argv":["git","-C","/private/tmp/q76-tdoed8ue/c-dyvva2_y/repo","cat-file","-t","de8cb68e698db5a8adf5a935f020c32ce29db9e7"],"cwd":"/private/tmp/q76-tdoed8ue/c-dyvva2_y/repo","stdout":"commit\n","stderr":"","exit":0,"returncode":0}},{"seq":30,"time":"2026-10-14T20:18:5